{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/vrtsbh","slide":1,"text":"Welcome to Quality of Care Is Not Activity Alone. This lesson begins with one principle: quality requires outcomes, safety, experience, equity, and continuity. We will connect that principle to an accountable health decision and make it testable in the companion notebook.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N11, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
