{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/szqd8jmx","slide":3,"text":"Each control must be explicit, reviewable, and owned.","textPreview":"Each control must be explicit, reviewable, and owned.","textChars":53,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,470,1100,45]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/eiprql","slide":3,"text":"These five controls form one operating chain. We begin with outcomes, move through safety and experience, and finish with equity and continuity. Every control must be explicit, reviewable, and owned.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N11, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
