{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2h4zqlc3","slide":7,"text":"SRAI BOOK 7  |  V7_B_N11","textPreview":"SRAI BOOK 7  |  V7_B_N11","textChars":24,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,28,520,24]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pkvi10vu","slide":7,"text":"07","textPreview":"07","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1150,650,50,24]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/4jmhsvu9","slide":7,"bbox":[58,64,1164,1]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fet0v6ds","slide":7,"text":"Guardrails are part of the analytical specification","textPreview":"Guardrails are part of the analytical specification","textChars":51,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,94,1100,52]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/utkzm1w7","slide":7,"bbox":[58,190,500,300]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hgbixgvi","slide":7,"text":"REQUIRED","textPreview":"REQUIRED","textChars":8,"textLines":1,"bbox":[86,220,440,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gf2hobed","slide":7,"text":"Evidence provenance\nVisible uncertainty\nHuman review and override\nIncident and retirement path","textPreview":"Evidence provenance | Visible uncertainty | Human review and override | Incident and retirement path","textChars":94,"textLines":4,"bbox":[86,274,420,155]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/zax07adw","slide":7,"bbox":[660,190,500,300]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e9ojy5cb","slide":7,"text":"PROHIBITED","textPreview":"PROHIBITED","textChars":10,"textLines":1,"bbox":[688,220,440,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0ja5obu1","slide":7,"text":"Silent delegation of authority\nAutomatic consequential action\nUnknown-code coercion\nFalse precision when evidence fails","textPreview":"Silent delegation of authority | Automatic consequential action | Unknown-code coercion | False precision when evidence fails","textChars":119,"textLines":4,"bbox":[688,274,420,155]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/a1tg9b","slide":7,"text":"These guardrails are functional requirements. Evidence provenance must be preserved. Uncertainty must be visible. Human review, override, incident response, and retirement must be defined. Silent delegation, automatic consequential action, and false precision are not acceptable.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N11, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
