{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hg7ilkb6","slide":8,"text":"If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer for review.","textPreview":"If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer for review.","textChars":62,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,568,1050,44]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/td47wk","slide":8,"text":"Before deployment, ask five questions. Is outcomes clear? Is safety documented? Is experience testable? Is equity governed? And is continuity explicit? If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer the system for review.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N11, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}